Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.01,0:00:05.86,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Three weeks have passed since that body
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.86,0:00:07.36,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,swapping business ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.56,0:00:10.53,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Nagase made a complete recovery,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.53,0:00:12.80,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,so we've been busy making \Nup for lost time
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.80,0:00:15.36,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,by working hard on the StuCS paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.46,0:00:20.61,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Three weeks ago, I told Nagase \Nhow I felt about her,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.57,0:00:23.73,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,and she said that she felt the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.46,0:00:28.44,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,But between her injury and \Nall the work on the paper,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.44,0:00:31.09,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,we haven't had a chance to talk alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.16,0:00:35.69,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,In any case, peace and \Nquiet had returned to the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.69,0:00:37.46,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,Yamaboshi Academy Student \NCultural Society.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.59,0:00:40.74,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Or so we thought,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.74,0:00:43.02,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,until school was over the next day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.72,0:02:20.49,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Here already?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.49,0:02:22.03,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,You're always early, Inaba.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.03,0:02:24.66,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I wasn't able to finish up at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.93,0:02:27.54,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I have to get this done today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.12,0:02:30.02,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Are Yui and Aoki around?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.02,0:02:32.44,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I need to check a few things.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.43,0:02:35.49,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,I ran into them on the way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.49,0:02:38.01,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,They'll be late because they're \Non monitor duty today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.01,0:02:42.48,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you find it annoying to \Nhave to wait all the time?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.48,0:02:45.01,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Even if you know it's not their fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.01,0:02:49.06,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, we can't blame them \Nif it's not their fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.06,0:02:51.20,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Makes you want to take \Nout your frustration on
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.20,0:02:52.60,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,whoever happens to be around, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.60,0:02:54.03,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.03,0:02:55.76,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,What's the point in that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.76,0:02:57.80,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,To feel better by blowing off steam.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.80,0:03:00.20,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,You've got a real nasty streak.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.47,0:03:04.57,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I've learned that complaining about \Nthings that only bother you a tiny bit
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.57,0:03:06.83,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,is actually good stress relief.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.83,0:03:08.68,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.68,0:03:11.17,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,You're able to reduce your own \Nstress by taking it out on me...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.17,0:03:15.68,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,And yet it doesn't really increase my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.26,0:03:21.34,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong, Inaba?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.99,0:03:29.14,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Inaba?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.45,0:03:38.29,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Wait... What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.29,0:03:39.82,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Does your back itch or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.95,0:03:46.16,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,H-Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.16,0:03:47.41,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.41,0:03:48.41,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,What's going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.02,0:03:51.16,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Take off your clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.16,0:03:53.84,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Wh-Why should I take off my clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.84,0:03:55.78,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,We have to take off \Nour clothes to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.78,0:03:57.42,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,To do what?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.42,0:03:59.21,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.21,0:04:02.63,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,You're just toying with \Nme to relieve stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.98,0:04:09.42,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Ow...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.06,0:04:11.14,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,I-Inaba!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.90,0:04:25.96,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.96,0:04:27.08,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.08,0:04:29.04,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Get off! Get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.04,0:04:30.36,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Wait! You've got it all wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.36,0:04:32.68,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Really, even I have no idea what's...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.71,0:04:35.75,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Inaba?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.88,0:04:42.76,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Can someone please explain
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.76,0:04:44.88,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,what the hell is going on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.66,0:04:47.77,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Yui?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.46,0:04:49.76,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.80,0:04:56.84,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.21,0:05:01.04,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Did I do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.04,0:05:01.98,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.30,0:05:03.85,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,'Sup!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.85,0:05:05.45,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa! The table!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.45,0:05:08.70,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,What happened?! How did it break?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.61,0:05:11.33,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, Yui. You're bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.67,0:05:12.70,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.70,0:05:14.28,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Iori!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.41,0:05:17.44,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong? Does it hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.44,0:05:18.97,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I'm going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.97,0:05:19.59,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.27,0:05:34.81,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,What was that all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.17,0:05:36.69,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Is it okay to leave it like this?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.08,0:05:43.86,CRKokoro,Rina,0000,0000,0000,,Are you going out, big brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.48,0:05:47.95,CRKokoro,Rina,0000,0000,0000,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.95,0:05:51.26,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Was I about to go outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.26,0:05:53.26,CRKokoro,Rina,0000,0000,0000,,Huh? What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.71,0:05:54.58,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.67,0:05:57.83,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,I need to take this call!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.10,0:06:04.20,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Hello? Is this Nagase?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.20,0:06:06.19,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Hey, Taichi! Tell me!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.19,0:06:07.29,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Are we...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.29,0:06:08.05,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.05,0:06:11.78,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Um! Er, what...?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.78,0:06:12.91,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.91,0:06:14.35,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,Did something happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.35,0:06:16.79,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}G-Good evening.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.79,0:06:18.52,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Er, yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.52,0:06:19.81,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.19,0:06:21.86,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.21,0:06:24.15,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,I'm confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.15,0:06:26.28,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,I think I called you unconsciously.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.70,0:06:29.95,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I had a feeling that I \Nneeded to talk to you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.95,0:06:34.16,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,A-Actually, I just had a \Nsudden urge to see you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.58,0:06:36.96,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}My body was moving by itself.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.96,0:06:38.16,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,You too?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.90,0:06:42.25,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Weird. Something's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.25,0:06:44.17,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Yeah...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.66,0:06:49.47,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Say, you had a feeling that you \Nneeded to talk to me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.86,0:06:51.02,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}What did you want to say?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.07,0:06:55.93,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,You wanted to talk to me too, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.92,0:06:58.26,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.12,0:07:00.78,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.12,0:07:04.57,CRKokoro,Both,0000,0000,0000,,I wanted to talk about the confession!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.06,0:07:10.06,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,W-We never had a chance \Nto clear things up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.06,0:07:11.61,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Have your...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.11,0:07:15.62,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Have your feelings changed since then?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.06,0:07:19.40,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,They haven't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.40,0:07:23.38,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,I still feel the same way I did then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.95,0:07:26.39,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Really...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.39,0:07:27.88,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.46,0:07:29.62,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Same here.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.87,0:07:40.65,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Um, I feel really \Nembarrassed right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.65,0:07:42.98,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}This is definitely embarrassing.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.15,0:07:46.90,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Th-That's enough for today!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.37,0:07:49.58,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Yeah, let's call it a day!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.58,0:07:52.20,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,O-Okay, we can do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.20,0:07:54.31,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Well, sorry about the weird phone call!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.31,0:07:54.96,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Bye!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.96,0:07:56.33,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, Nagase!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.74,0:07:59.79,CRKokoro,Rina,0000,0000,0000,,Your girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.95,0:08:03.00,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Sh-She's not my girlfriend!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.00,0:08:04.91,CRKokoro,Rina,0000,0000,0000,,Look at you blush.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.91,0:08:06.43,CRKokoro,Rina,0000,0000,0000,,But that's good to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.43,0:08:09.76,CRKokoro,Rina,0000,0000,0000,,You were acting weird before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.11,0:08:13.01,CRKokoro,Rina,0000,0000,0000,,You're still acting kind of weird,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.01,0:08:14.89,CRKokoro,Rina,0000,0000,0000,,but at least I know it's \Nbecause you're lovesick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.89,0:08:16.36,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,You've got it wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.36,0:08:20.67,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, maybe it's better \Nto leave it at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.67,0:08:21.48,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.88,0:08:24.27,CRKokoro,Rina,0000,0000,0000,,You're so cute, big brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.23,0:08:30.53,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, how do you know \Nwhat it means to be lovesick?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.53,0:08:33.53,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,You need to give your big \Nbrother a proper explanation!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.44,0:08:51.68,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,I-Inaba!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.68,0:08:52.97,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,About yesterday...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.46,0:08:58.51,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,U-Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.51,0:08:59.98,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,There's trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.98,0:09:01.77,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Yui and Aoki were taken \Ninto police custody.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.77,0:09:02.76,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.21,0:09:04.02,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.02,0:09:06.54,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know any details,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.54,0:09:09.52,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,but the teachers were talking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.52,0:09:12.34,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,I tried calling them, but \Nneither of them are answering.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.34,0:09:13.99,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,The cops have them now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.30,0:09:15.69,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.69,0:09:17.15,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.15,0:09:19.41,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Why would the police take Aoki \Nand Kiriyama into custody?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.41,0:09:21.89,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Hell if I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.89,0:09:25.05,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Doesn't anyone have more information?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.05,0:09:26.17,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,You rang?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.17,0:09:26.79,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.43,0:09:28.79,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Fujishima...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.79,0:09:32.67,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Um, I don't think anyone \Nwas talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.67,0:09:35.59,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, if you know something, tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.59,0:09:37.67,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,You shouldn't order people around
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.67,0:09:41.73,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,when asking for a favor, Inaba-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.94,0:09:45.97,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Please tell us what you \Nknow, Fujishima-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.97,0:09:47.81,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.51,0:09:51.80,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,If you let me rent \NNagase-san for two hours,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.80,0:09:53.20,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll consider it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.20,0:09:54.71,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,Wha...?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.71,0:09:56.76,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,It's a small price to pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.76,0:09:59.49,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure that Nagase-san will \Nbe happy with the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.49,0:10:01.15,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Fujishima.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.15,0:10:02.73,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,That's dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.71,0:10:04.83,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Don't touch her!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.15,0:10:06.47,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}There it is again!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.39,0:10:13.54,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,What are you trying to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.62,0:10:17.38,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing, Yaegashi-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.38,0:10:18.82,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,Dance practice?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.82,0:10:21.37,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Not exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.37,0:10:22.71,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.71,0:10:25.54,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,If we can find out what \Nhappened to Aoki and Yui,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.54,0:10:27.47,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,you can have two or three hours!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.47,0:10:29.52,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,So tell us, Fujishima-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.52,0:10:31.41,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,That was a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.41,0:10:34.23,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,I was going to tell you anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.23,0:10:35.03,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.03,0:10:37.78,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,It was a joke?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.78,0:10:39.28,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,My sacrifice was for nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.28,0:10:42.77,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,You guys looked way too serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.77,0:10:46.18,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,I was trying to inject a little humor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.74,0:10:48.44,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,But I didn't think you would
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.44,0:10:50.00,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,be so mortified by the idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.52,0:10:54.37,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,This morning, a group of \Nboys from Akitaka High were
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.37,0:10:56.42,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,giving some girls from \Nour school trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.67,0:11:02.01,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,Kiriyama-san happened to \Npass by and beat them up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.01,0:11:04.52,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,But it sounds like she \Nused too much force,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.52,0:11:07.23,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,so the cops wanted to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.09,0:11:10.81,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,That's when Aoki-kun showed \Nup and went off on them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.81,0:11:13.95,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,"Where are you taking \Nher? Let her go!"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.95,0:11:16.30,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,I hear that he put up a good fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.82,0:11:20.85,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,Well, she was helping girls \Nfrom the same school,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.85,0:11:23.20,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,so she should get off with a warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.20,0:11:24.98,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Hell yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.98,0:11:27.51,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,If they try to punish her,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.51,0:11:30.09,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll do whatever it takes to stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.09,0:11:33.17,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,How do you know what \Nhappened, Fujishima-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.50,0:11:37.98,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,My dad happens to be a high-ranking cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.98,0:11:39.77,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.77,0:11:41.87,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Glad to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.87,0:11:44.48,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,This connection will come in handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.48,0:11:46.47,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,It won't come free.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.47,0:11:49.14,CRKokoro,Fuji,0000,0000,0000,,Though I can give you a discount.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.21,0:11:53.60,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,A conspiracy is born.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.60,0:11:55.26,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,This partnership scares me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.57,0:12:00.86,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,So Kiriyama and Aoki \Nnever came to school.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.58,0:12:04.68,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, I've been thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.68,0:12:07.66,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Kiriyama beat up boys from \Nanother school, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.66,0:12:09.08,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,But she's...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.08,0:12:11.34,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I was also wondering about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.83,0:12:13.98,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Yui suffers from androphobia.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.98,0:12:16.42,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,She's a lot better now,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.42,0:12:18.31,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,but not to the point where she could
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.31,0:12:20.09,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,grapple with a bunch of boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.09,0:12:21.03,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.92,0:12:24.18,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,You also acted strangely this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.18,0:12:25.40,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.40,0:12:28.56,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Did you hear a voice in your head?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.56,0:12:30.68,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,You heard it, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.68,0:12:32.56,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Both of you could hear it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.99,0:12:38.27,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,Long time no see, people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.27,0:12:42.51,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,Or maybe it hasn't been that long.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.44,0:12:44.82,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,Has it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.82,0:12:46.66,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Heartseed!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.91,0:12:50.41,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, did you all start hearing
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.41,0:12:53.41,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,voices in your heads yesterday?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.15,0:12:59.72,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,And then your body automatically \Ndoes what your mind wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.72,0:13:02.04,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Stop messing with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.04,0:13:03.80,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,We're not your guinea pigs!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.19,0:13:08.50,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I haven't apologized \Nto Nagase-san yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.97,0:13:12.21,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,I would like to say that I'm sorry
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.21,0:13:15.23,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,from somewhere around \Nthe middle of my heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.23,0:13:19.48,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,If you're sorry, you \Nshould leave us alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.70,0:13:24.20,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,No, I'm repeating myself here,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.20,0:13:27.74,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,but you people truly fascinate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.52,0:13:31.19,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,So to explain what's \Nhappening this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.19,0:13:37.29,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,your deepest desires \Nhave been unleashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.29,0:13:39.38,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Our desires have been unleashed?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.66,0:13:41.74,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,As I mentioned before,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.74,0:13:45.35,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,this phenomena will end when \Nit's no longer entertaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.77,0:13:48.36,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,You could say
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.36,0:13:53.27,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,that I'm helping you \Ndiscover your true selves.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.73,0:13:56.39,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,True selves...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.39,0:13:57.94,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I have a question.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.94,0:13:59.84,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Is it against the rules to \Nhide in our rooms?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.84,0:14:00.52,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.52,0:14:06.20,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, Inaba-san is very sharp.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.20,0:14:09.99,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,All I have to say is \Nthat hiding in your room
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.99,0:14:12.69,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,could be just as entertaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.69,0:14:14.91,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,If not, I can make it entertaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.30,0:14:17.92,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Make it entertaining...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.14,0:14:21.35,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,I'm being a little too generous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.35,0:14:23.21,CRKokoro,Heart,0000,0000,0000,,So long then.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.76,0:14:29.05,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,So it's Heartseed again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.41,0:14:31.43,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry about making you worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.73,0:14:33.25,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,You don't need to apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.77,0:14:36.62,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I wasn't worried about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.62,0:14:38.10,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,That hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.10,0:14:39.94,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,That really hurt, Inaba-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.16,0:14:43.32,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,I'm glad that you got \Noff with a warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.56,0:14:46.98,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I made out fine...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.57,0:14:50.21,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,And Kiriyama's absent again today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.66,0:14:54.19,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Yui wanted to save those girls
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.19,0:14:56.36,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,so badly that she beat up the boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.86,0:14:58.98,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,You wanted to stop the cops\N from taking her away
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.98,0:15:01.42,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,so badly that you put up a struggle.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.42,0:15:03.21,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Under normal circumstances,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.21,0:15:05.62,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,you would have shown \Nself-restraint and stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.62,0:15:07.88,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,But your desires were unleashed
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.88,0:15:10.47,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,and you acted upon them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.47,0:15:13.71,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,That's probably what happened when Yui
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.71,0:15:15.52,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,broke the table two days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.52,0:15:19.10,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,So when Inaba made a move on me...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.49,0:15:24.51,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Stop talking!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.51,0:15:26.26,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,You have the sensitivity of a rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.26,0:15:28.82,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Do not mention how I disgraced myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.82,0:15:31.74,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Hell. Want me to pummel you \Nuntil you forget it happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.19,0:15:33.84,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.84,0:15:34.99,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.20,0:15:38.25,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,See? Look what happened!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.25,0:15:40.10,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Idiot! Moron! Dumbass!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.10,0:15:41.46,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,S-Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.01,0:15:43.89,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,It's no big deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.40,0:15:46.49,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Two days ago, before you showed up,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.49,0:15:49.06,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,my desires were unleashed,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.06,0:15:54.88,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,and I kinda put some moves on Taichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.88,0:15:57.43,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.43,0:15:59.27,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,But don't get the wrong idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.27,0:16:01.80,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,This was right after I happened to
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.80,0:16:04.27,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,come across some dirty pictures.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.70,0:16:08.57,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I-I don't know how far I would have gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.57,0:16:11.99,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,But it probably wouldn't \Nhave been too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.62,0:16:13.64,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I think...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.24,0:16:15.79,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Since I have no experience...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.65,0:16:19.29,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Moving on!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.29,0:16:22.62,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,When we were swapping \Nbodies, we were able
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.62,0:16:25.30,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,to keep everything amongst ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.30,0:16:27.80,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,But that won't work when \Nour desires are unleashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.80,0:16:29.96,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Yui and Aoki have already used
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.96,0:16:31.76,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,violence against other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.76,0:16:36.18,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Right, outsiders might end up \Ngetting involved this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.51,0:16:39.66,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,We have two options right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.66,0:16:43.44,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,The first would be to \Nsuppress your emotions.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.44,0:16:46.19,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,The second would be to \Njust not think about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.19,0:16:48.22,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,to go wild and have more fun than usual
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.22,0:16:51.27,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,instead of keeping yourself in check.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.27,0:16:52.44,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.68,0:16:55.67,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Basically, either you take it easy so
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.67,0:16:58.04,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,you don't have any dangerous urges,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.04,0:17:00.98,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,or you do whatever you want
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.98,0:17:04.08,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,to avoid any stress build-up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.51,0:17:08.71,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Both options sound difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.88,0:17:10.95,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,That's amazing, Inaban!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.95,0:17:13.47,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,You already have a plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.47,0:17:15.62,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Sucking up won't do you any good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.62,0:17:19.10,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,It's also important to help each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.07,0:17:23.26,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah... That's an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.26,0:17:25.45,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Hm? Is it a bad idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.45,0:17:27.34,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,No, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.34,0:17:29.21,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,It makes sense to help each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.18,0:17:32.65,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,The rest is up to luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.65,0:17:34.43,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,We'll just have to play it by ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.88,0:17:36.86,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,That's all I have to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.99,0:17:41.54,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure Yui will be here tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.54,0:17:43.16,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,We can continue this discussion then.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.16,0:17:48.15,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I don't know what would \Nbe the right thing to do,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.15,0:17:50.90,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,but we should be fine \Nif we work together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.90,0:17:52.48,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Yup, I just know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.03,0:17:54.77,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,It's all you, Taichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.77,0:17:56.58,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,You have to be there for Iori.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.58,0:17:57.43,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.43,0:18:01.04,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,But I'll be helping everyone, \Nnot just Nagase.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.04,0:18:04.56,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,You only need to worry about Iori.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.05,0:18:07.18,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,And Aoki can take care of Yui.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.18,0:18:09.86,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, you're not up to the task.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.13,0:18:12.85,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,It's a bad idea to sell me short.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.85,0:18:15.90,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Wait, aren't you coming \Nto class, Inaban?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.25,0:18:18.94,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I still need to work on the paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.94,0:18:20.73,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be there in a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.73,0:18:22.46,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,We can help.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.46,0:18:23.93,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.93,0:18:26.26,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Just go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.26,0:18:29.42,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I can't get any work done \Nwhen you're around.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.87,0:18:30.88,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.42,0:18:47.84,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Did I pull it off?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.72,0:18:52.02,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,Is everyone else doing okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.89,0:18:57.89,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.90,0:19:06.33,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Taichi, can you talk now?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.74,0:19:10.22,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Sure. You usually don't call this late.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.73,0:19:13.64,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Sorry, there's something \NI wanted to say.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.15,0:19:16.30,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Picking up where we left off before...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.68,0:19:19.85,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,O-Oh, that...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.38,0:19:23.73,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}This might not be the best time,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.73,0:19:27.74,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}but I think this is important, too.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.93,0:19:32.90,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Can we go status quo for now?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.90,0:19:33.61,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.76,0:19:36.63,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Status quo?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.63,0:19:42.14,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,I realize that I probably \Nsound stuck-up,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.14,0:19:44.63,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,but I think it's a good idea to
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.63,0:19:46.74,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,maintain our distance for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.34,0:19:51.09,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}You know how our desires are{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.09,0:19:54.36,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}basically out of control now?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.36,0:19:55.13,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.72,0:19:59.00,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,I feel like it would be a \Nbad idea to get closer
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.00,0:20:01.13,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,under those circumstances.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.44,0:20:03.76,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.76,0:20:07.93,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I wasn't thinking clearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.93,0:20:11.10,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,That would be dangerous for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.10,0:20:13.92,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Very dangerous.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.70,0:20:17.19,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Who knows what we might do?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.71,0:20:21.07,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Also, I have something to confess.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.07,0:20:22.15,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Confess?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.00,0:20:27.74,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,I still lack confidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.47,0:20:33.80,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Sometimes, I wonder if \Nthis is really okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.44,0:20:37.17,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}So I'm a little excited about{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.17,0:20:38.99,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}having our desires unleashed.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.71,0:20:40.92,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Excited?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.78,0:20:45.18,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,My deepest desires will be unleashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.18,0:20:48.92,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,That may help me discover the real me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.92,0:20:51.46,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,I can't help but look forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.34,0:20:56.25,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I don't want to be so selfish,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.00,0:20:59.54,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}but I can't help myself.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.95,0:21:02.99,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Okay, confession time's over!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.99,0:21:04.83,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Sorry about keeping you up!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.83,0:21:06.50,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}I'll buy you lunch or something.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.37,0:21:09.95,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,That's the real you talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.95,0:21:10.72,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.21,0:21:17.04,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}The real you is making these \Nobjective observations.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.81,0:21:19.92,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}You can discover elements{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.92,0:21:23.28,CRKokoro,,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}of the real you in your everyday life.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.45,0:21:28.22,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}When you're around, it feels \Nlike everything will be okay.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.98,0:21:29.89,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,{\i1}Bye.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.30,0:21:32.12,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.33,0:21:40.29,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,Everything will be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.29,0:21:41.98,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll find a way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.55,0:21:50.16,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,I can't screw up this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.66,0:21:56.68,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,Yahoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.79,0:21:58.68,CRKokoro,Aoki,0000,0000,0000,,Cute! Sunny! Strong! Super cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.70,0:21:57.96,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Wait! Wait! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.96,0:22:00.12,CRKokoro,Yui,0000,0000,0000,,Don't look! I made a huge mistake!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.12,0:22:02.75,CRKokoro,Ina,0000,0000,0000,,I guess I'm not good enough for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.75,0:22:04.80,CRKokoro,Iori,0000,0000,0000,,How would I know?! Don't ask me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.80,0:22:06.13,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm disappointed, Inaba.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.13,0:22:08.55,CRKokoro,Tai,0000,0000,0000,,I never thought you would \Ngive up on your friends.
